---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../../lib/siteUrl';
---

<Layout title="Report an Issue" description="How to report a Varve bug or feature request: what information to include, where to file it, and what response to expect from a solo-developer project.">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="support-page">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href={sitePath('/support')}>Support</a> / Report Issue
      </nav>

      <h1>Report an Issue</h1>
      <p class="support-intro">
        Help improve Varve by reporting bugs with detailed information.
      </p>

      <div class="report-section">
        <h2>Before Reporting</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Check the <a href={sitePath('/support/faq')}>FAQ</a> for common questions</li>
          <li>Check <a href={sitePath('/support/troubleshooting')}>Troubleshooting</a> for known issues</li>
          <li>Check <a href={sitePath('/support/known-issues')}>Known Issues</a> to see if your issue is already tracked</li>
          <li>Search <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/issues">GitHub Issues</a> for similar reports</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="report-section">
        <h2>Bug Report Template</h2>
        <p>When reporting a bug, please include the following information:</p>

        <div class="template-block">
          <h3>Bug Report</h3>
          <pre><code>**Varve Version:** [from Help > About]
**Operating System:** [e.g., CachyOS Linux, Ubuntu 22.04, macOS 14, Windows 11]
**Architecture:** [e.g., x86_64, ARM64]
**Package:** [e.g., AppImage, deb, dmg, msi]

**Description:**
[Brief description of the bug]

**Steps to Reproduce:**
1. [Step 1]
2. [Step 2]
3. [Step 3]

**Expected Behavior:**
[What should happen]

**Actual Behavior:**
[What actually happens]

**Logs/Screenshots:**
[Attach relevant logs or screenshots, mask personal data]</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="report-section">
        <h2>Feature Request Template</h2>
        <p>When requesting a feature, please include the following information:</p>

        <div class="template-block">
          <h3>Feature Request</h3>
          <pre><code>**Problem Statement:**
[What problem are you trying to solve?]

**Proposed Solution:**
[What feature would solve this?]

**Alternatives Considered:**
[What alternatives have you considered?]

**Additional Context:**
[Links to related issues, screenshots, examples]</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="report-section">
        <h2>Where to Report</h2>
        <p>Report issues on GitHub:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/issues">GitHub Issues</a> - For bugs and feature requests</li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/discussions">GitHub Discussions</a> - For questions and general discussion</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="report-section">
        <h2>Security Issues</h2>
        <p>For security vulnerabilities, please report privately:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/security/advisories">GitHub Security Advisory</a> - Private vulnerability reporting</li>
          <li>Email: security@k-arthur.design</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Response time for security issues is typically within 48 hours for critical vulnerabilities.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="report-cta">
        <h2>Ready to report?</h2>
        <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/issues/new" class="btn-primary">Open an Issue on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .support-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .support-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .support-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .report-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .report-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .report-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .report-section ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .report-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .report-section li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-link-hover);
  }
  
  .report-section a {
    color: var(--text-link);
  }
  
  .template-block {
    background: var(--surface-muted);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .template-block h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .template-block pre {
    background: var(--surface-code);
    color: var(--text-code);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  
  .template-block code {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  
  .report-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  }
  
  .report-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
